{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルピーの酒井さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/21/3591820/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、我らが早出さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/21/3591820/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が来てくださいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"酒井さんが\nなかだかなキレキレだった\nと言ってくださったよ！！わーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーは\nまりちゃ、さゆにゃん、玲香、まいやん、かずみんが来てくれたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCでかずみんが急遽\n特別出演しましたね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は実は中田は\n12公演の中で出番が少ない方で\n逆に気持ち的に\n唯一、余裕がある日だったので\nすごい楽しんでできたと思います＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、\n今日はいつもの髪型じゃなかったから\nダンスもちょっと違いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/21/3591820/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈が好きな方の髪型！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はダンスが髪型で変わるんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近 気づきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/21/3591820/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}